d\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create form exposes a single-select \\\"Category *\\\" combobox with exactly Tech Gadgets / Home Goods / Fitness. Selecting \\\"Home Goods\\\" for new product \\\"QA Aeropress Go\\\" saved it with a Home badge in the admin list and it now appears on /category/home (4 items) and under the Home Goods filter, not under Tech or Fitness.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products the category combobox filtered correctly: Tech Gadgets → 3 products found (all Tech), Home Goods → 3 (Breville, Philips Hue, Dyson), Fitness → 3 (Bowflex, Theragun, Peloton). Count text updated each time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products lists 9 products; each card shows name, category badge (Tech/Home/Fitness), price, star rating + numeric value, brief review paragraph, image, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" link.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort options Newest/Top Rated/Price Low-High/Price High-Low all reorder correctly (asc: 199→2495; desc: 2495→199; Top Rated: 4.9→4.4). Min-rating \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" reduced 9→8 (excluded 4.4 Philips Hue). Price slider dragged to $2410 max reduced 8→7 (excluded $2,495 Peloton).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No persistence — product data is held only in memory and resets to the seed data on every page reload\", \"actual\": \"After creating \\\"QA Aeropress Go\\\"/\\\"QA Trail Recovery Press\\\" and editing Sony WH-1000XM5's tags and featured flag, reloading http://localhost:6001/category/fitness returned only the 3 seeded Fitness products — the created product was gone. Reloading /product/qa-aeropress-go earlier showed \\\"Product Not Found\\\". Sony's detail page after reload again shows the original tags headphones/wireless